msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫The archangel stood proudly upon "
"his glass perch,⟪k:12⟫looking down at me."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫⟪k:3⟫⟪k:4⟫⟪k:5⟫⟪k:6⟫⟪k:7⟫⟪k:8⟫⟪k:9⟫⟪k:10⟫⟪k:11⟫O arcanjo permanecia orgulhosamente "
"em seu poleiro de vidro,⟪k:12⟫olhando para mim."

#: scenario7:scenario7_3685A8D2_76B9_410A_92EE_946FC39B311A
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: bf28098cd1119e52b4d5ffdb48de00bab145804cf1ae10286c80918ffeffd8c6
