msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Seu olhar quase parecia... ⟪k:1⟫julgador."

#: scenario7:scenario7_2B06C58F_460D_4798_B82E_E24EB9845EA2
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 7e60e0086f0302a0d47264aa8d44cea261dac614faf7f7f97a43da747eefbd33
