msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_923AF344_9FE7_4626_B420_7B87C0EBD422"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫For the day someone would truly set me free."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Pelo dia em que alguém realmente me libertaria."

#: scenario7:scenario7_80B67623_550E_4CB4_8CB0_B22D8892A316
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: b4699e721b1b98753d2cbd8d2dbc282d53f7c31738e2951f81062a2de21415fe
#. default-sha256: b587bd23a9769260f2eb27d73a5d7cae2378378405964739900726019f595005
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_80B67623_550E_4CB4_8CB0_B22D8892A316"
msgid "⟪k:0⟫That you were led here—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫that you were ⟪k:3⟫meant⟪k:4⟫ to come to this place."
msgstr ""
"⟪k:0⟫Que você foi trazido aqui—⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫que você era ⟪k:3⟫destinado⟪k:4⟫ a vir a este lugar "

#: scenario7:scenario7_83BBBECD_3144_4476_8C30_E5D98FFBA6B1
#. Edit msgstr; keep protected ⟪k:N⟫ markers in source order.
#. native-sha256: 2a6e87f07576b9e73abe9579bf4d85c4581d24a0ecf1b5a6692d3a3d8a35b8f0
#. default-sha256: 136fa602d3636ba1dcbfed6b3086940fa305ce050d795d8bd03fb2bd366202aa
msgctxt "scenario7:scenario7_83BBBECD_3144_4476_8C30_E5D98FFBA6B1"
msgid ""
"⟪k:0⟫I know how it feels to be locked up...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫to be tortured and used for others’ gain."
msgstr "⟪k:0⟫Eu sei como é ser preso...⟪k:1⟫⟪k:2⟫ser torturado e usado pelo ganho de outros."

#: scenario7:scenario7_073CCD59_A5F1_4026_98A1_77E035B7B0DA
